// IntroString :
"P293242890" "I have discovered a rare occurrence! Amongst the dregs of the Infected an individual with actual super-powers has emerged! He has manifested the ability to project bio-generated electricity from his body and adopted the hero-name of Biopulse. This is the perfect opportunity to obtain a live specimen for experimentation! Muhahaha!<br><br>We must move quickly though; already Biopulse has been seen talking with Longbow, hoping to gain support and champion the cause of the Infected. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Stop Biopulse from joining Longbow!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P942996664" "Stop Biopulse from joining Longbow"
// SendOffString :
"P117556466" "Once you have defeated that do-gooder wannabe, I'll have him shipped to my lab for dissection!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1445590703" ""Defeat Biopulse and witnesses"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P702369798" "Have you defeated Biopulse yet? Well? What are you waiting for? Perhaps you WANT to see another hero running around the streets? Get moving!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2793590800" "According to Doctor Creed, Biopulse was last seen entering this part of the Mercy sewers."

